{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "129",
 "name": "Pilgramage Trail",
 "file": "Map129_Pilgramage_Trail.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":120,"y":80,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Foyer","descriptions":["Carved granite urns filled with leafy ferns flank a silverwood door.  Octagonal tiles of silver-flecked black stone line the floor.  The walls feature frescos that depict the same landscape during each of the four seasons."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":2,"x":100,"y":80,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Infirmary","descriptions":["Partitioned from the rest of the building by folding screens, the size of the infirmary can be changed as needed to accommodate patients.  Shelves of supplies line the walls, while a battered worktable is shoved beneath a window.  A stack of stained pallets near a cast iron stove bears silent testimony to the work which has been done here."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":140,"y":80,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Gathering Room","descriptions":["A large stone fireplace dominates one wall of the windowless room.  A mismatched pair of shabby leather chairs huddles close to the hearth, while battered pine benches, with iron braziers placed beside them to warm chilled toes, provide extra seating.  Tables topped with carved slabs of granite, each boasting a pewter candelabrum, are placed within easy reach of most of the seating."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":120,"y":60,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Altar","descriptions":["Worn smooth by the passage of time and countless feet, the floor is tiled with marble vela'tohr flowers set within black granite octagons.  Ceiling beams are carved with a series of bloom-covered vines that twist between evenly spaced chandeliers.  The curved walls of the rotunda are lavishly painted with a fresco that depicts a variety of animals.  By comparison, the marble altar in the middle of the room seems plain."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Altar","Zachriedek","Favor"]},
  {"id":5,"x":100,"y":60,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Mud Room","descriptions":["Wool hangings woven into geometric patterns cover the walls, creating a windbreak between the door and the rest of the guildhall.  Dried flakes of mud cling to a brass bootjack shoved halfway underneath a silverwillow wicker chair.  A wooden rack holds numerous pairs of footwear, most of which have been encrusted in various substances."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":140,"y":60,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Refectory","descriptions":["Polished copper pots and pans hang upon the wall on either side of a large stove.  Candle sconces are affixed to the other walls, between cluttered shelves stacked with culinary equipment and supplies.  A pair of large trestle tables fills most of the room, surrounded by threadbare runners lining the barely passable areas between the fixtures and the benches by the tables."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":160,"y":40,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, East Courtyard","descriptions":["Thriving plants in large glazed pots threaten to overwhelm the dusty courtyard.  Covered cisterns conceal most of a fortified wall.  Pathways paved with octagonal flagstones meander through a potted garden, connecting an iron gate, the door to the main building, and a small cottage."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":160,"y":60,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Guildleader's Office","descriptions":["An aged silverwillow desk sits in the center of the room.  Woven in shades of green and gold, a faded rug patterned with wheat sheaves stretches between the door and a pierced stone screen.  Scroll-filled shelves take up most of the space near the walls, leaving barely any room for a window."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Cleric","Vecuto"]},
  {"id":9,"x":160,"y":40,"z":2,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Cloisters","descriptions":["Rows of candles arranged on tall iron stands illuminate this end of the cloisters with a soft golden glow.  Dryads carved into the exposed rafters peer down, as if scrutinizing all who come and go in their domain."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":10,"x":140,"y":40,"z":2,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Cloisters","descriptions":["A fresco occupies one wall, its ashen hues illustrating somber scenes.  The aroma of incense drifts up from a shallow copper bowl resting on a low table between two doors."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":11,"x":120,"y":40,"z":2,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Cloisters","descriptions":["Illuminated by candlelight from above, heavy wool tapestries are spaced evenly between numerous doorways.  Straw mats line the floors throughout the corridor, providing a buffer between feet and the stone."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":12,"x":100,"y":40,"z":2,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Cloisters","descriptions":["Carved silverwillow beams run the length of the corridor, supporting the sloping ceiling.  Suspended at regular intervals from the elevated end of the hallway, chandeliers illuminate the cloisters with candlelight.  Laid end-to-end, woven straw mats speckled with drips of wax soften the stone floor underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":13,"x":80,"y":40,"z":2,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Cloisters","descriptions":["Woven straw mats run the length of the hall, offering a measure of protection against the stone floor beneath.  Multi-colored wool hangings work as a similar buffer for the walls.  A brass telescope on a battered tripod points towards a large window."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":14,"x":80,"y":40,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, West Courtyard","descriptions":["Torches gutter and flicker in sheltered spots, casting a pale light over large cisterns and a large building which blots out a portion of the southern night sky.  A vine-covered wall enclosing the compound curves to the north and south and disappears into the darkness.  A cast iron gate allows access into a smaller building, while a stout door leads into the main building.","A small brick building faces an iron gate on opposite sides of the dusty courtyard.  A stout door on the south side leads back into the largest building.  Granite cisterns are wedged snugly against the various buildings, positioned to collect rainwater and snow melt funneled by drip channels cut into each sloping roof.  Sickly ivy clings tenaciously to the fortified wall curving protectively around the compound."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":15,"x":120,"y":100,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Outer Courtyard","descriptions":["Flickering lanterns flank a thin pathway which leads from the front gate to a large building.  Shadows cast by the large boulders in the lawn dance upon the sere grass.  Steeply pitched roofs on the buildings within the compound help ward off the elements during the harsher seasons.","The buildings within the compound have steeply pitched roofs that help ward off the elements during the harsher seasons.  A broad expanse of sere grass which lies between the gate and large buildings is littered with rock and boulders."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":16,"x":140,"y":100,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Courtyard","descriptions":["A dusty gravel path leads to the center of the courtyard where a small dark statue of a raccoon stands.  Hewn cedar benches encircle the area, providing a restful place for contemplation."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":17,"x":120,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Outside the Monastery","descriptions":["Rising to intimidating heights, the fortified wall enclosing the compound is broken only by a stout ironwood gate.  A lit torch at the gate brightens the bronze fittings and a plaque which is clearly marked with the crest of the Clerics' Guild.","Rising to intimidating heights, the fortified wall enclosing the compound is broken only by a stout ironwood gate.  The gate displays a bronze plaque engraved with the crest of the Clerics' Guild superimposed over a towering mountain."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":18,"x":140,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["Making for treacherous footing in the dark, an uneven jumble of cobblestones paves the way down the rocky slope.  Intermittent gusts of wind swirl through the area, carrying the faint crisp scent of ice.","In desperate need of realignment, the uneven jumble of cobblestones forming the road meanders down the gentle slope.  A sturdy wall rises to the north, the sharpened stakes along the top pointing skyward like a line of spears raised in defense.  Yellowing grasses, well nibbled by the goats which roam in the valley, cover much of the rocky ground."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":19,"x":160,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["Stones shift alarmingly underfoot, requiring extra care while traversing the road in the dark.  Birds twitter sleepily from the tree branches overhead.","Dominating the view to the north, a mountain looms over the small settlement.  At once beautiful and forbidding, the crags and ice-capped peaks display a multiplicity of hues and textures.  Reaching endlessly for the sky, sheer bluffs and level terraces juxtaposed with jagged cliffs range in subtle shades between black, blue-grey and white."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":20,"x":160,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Overlook","descriptions":["The trees thin to the north, exposing a warm twinkle of lights indicating a small settlement down slope.  Occasionally a small, rodent-like creature scurries out of the concealing vegetation beside the road to disappear into the thick grass on the other side.","From the top of a rise overlooking the valley, the road affords a view of cultivated terraced fields divided by low walls of dark stone.  Goats dot the hillside, grazing on the tall grasses covering the rocky slopes beyond the fields.  Centered within this pastoral vista is a complex of buildings enclosed by fortified walls."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":21,"x":160,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Forest","descriptions":["Thick tree trunks crowd close together while twisted branches weave a dense canopy overhead, all but blocking the view of the night sky and enshrouding the road in velvety darkness.  A fickle breeze sporadically rustles through the branches, cutting the scent of damp earth and decay hanging in the air.","Heavily wooded hills rise on both sides as the road winds among them.  Glimpsed through the thinning trees to the north, a narrow valley nestles beneath the looming shadow of a snow-capped mountain standing silent watch over the terrain.  A fickle breeze sporadically rustles through the branches, cutting the scent of damp earth and leaf mold hanging in the air."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":22,"x":140,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Forest","descriptions":["Fresh gouges bleed yellow sap where something has sharpened its claws on a giant pine.  The glistening sap-glazed bark contrasts with the muted grey-green moss mottling the trunks of the other trees.  Providing shelter to a family of bushy-tailed woodrats, a thick tangle of red currant bushes adds a bright splash of color.  The occasional shriek of a hawk brings about a temporary cessation of rustling in the undergrowth."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":23,"x":120,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Forest","descriptions":["The rustle of twigs and needles is constant as the pine trees move with the slightest disturbance in the air.  The rugged trail continues its meandering way through the wooded foothills.","Eternally mantled in snow and ice, the Arncharn Shel mountains rule the eastern horizon.  Soaring high above the dense forest, the stony windswept heights are painted numerous shades of grey.  The rugged trail continues its meandering way through the wooded foothills."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":24,"x":100,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Forest","descriptions":["Cattails and bulrushes cluster thickly along the shores of a small pond nestled in a dip in the terrain.  The forest itself is quiet, the stillness broken by a sporadic breeze rustling through the pine boughs.","Cattails and bulrushes cluster thickly along the shores of a small pond nestled in a dip in the terrain.  Faint wisps of mist cling to the surface of the water.  The forest itself is quiet, the stillness broken by occasional birdsong and the wind rustling through the pine boughs."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":25,"x":80,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Forest","descriptions":["Showing tell-tale signs of foot traffic, the narrow path creeps between the boles of ancient pines.  Many years' accumulation of rusty-brown needles and splintering pinecones carpet the ground, providing ample forage for squirrels and birds."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":26,"x":100,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["Flickers of golden lantern light can be glimpsed between the stakes surmounting the high, thick wall running alongside the road.  Low mounds of blackberry brambles cover the rocky slope on the opposite side of the track.","Browning clumps of grass push up between cracked cobblestones, obscuring the edges of the roadway.  Low mounds of blackberry brambles cover the rocky slope to the south, grudgingly giving way to cultivated fields to the west.  Steeply pitched roofs can be glimpsed between the stakes surmounting the high, thick wall stretching east to west alongside the road."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":27,"x":80,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["A faint orange glow rises above the dark wall from the torches and lamps of the buildings within.  Chill breezes mutter through the dry grass, carrying a faintly disturbing scent of decay and ash.","The fortified wall enclosing the monastery grounds turns north here, sheltering the huddled buildings and those within from weather and wildlife.  Terraced fields rise to the south and west, scenting the vagrant breeze with mulched soil and cultivated vegetation."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":28,"x":60,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Trade Outpost","descriptions":["Most of the buildings crowding around the square are closed against the night, waiting stoically for the coming of dawn.  Flickering lantern light escapes through the wooden shutters of some of the shops, providing scant illumination and proving not all business halted with the setting of the sun.","The cobblestone road ends in a broad square crowded with thatch-roofed buildings and shops, their brick chimneys emitting wisps of bluish smoke.  Winding northwards, a packed earth track continues towards the mountains in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":29,"x":60,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["A high wall along the dirt road prevents goats from wandering into the monastery's fields.  The intermittent, brisk snap of cloth fluttering in wind emanates from somewhere in the night off the west side of the track.","A high wall lines one side of the dirt road and prevents goats from wandering into the monastery's fields.  Orderly rows of stunted yet healthy plants peek over the top of the weathered stone.  Strung on a taut line stretched between two notched stakes, tattered scraps of cloth flutter in the fickle breeze."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":30,"x":60,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["Dry grasses whisper in supplication as they bow beneath the frigid breezes, punctuated by the sounds of scree crunching underfoot.  Looming out of the darkness, a smooth stone wall is broken by a wooden gate which offers access to one of the plots of terraced farmland.","Yellowing grass along the rutted track is slowly losing its battle with mortality.  Clumps of weeds skirt the stone wall enclosing a field with scarcely a break for the gate.  Towards the north, a dark line of trees is visible in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":31,"x":60,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Forest","descriptions":["Partially obscured by fallen pine needles, the soft earth holds the small paw prints of a fox.  Matted tufts of grey fur, the remains of some rodent, are strewn before a hollow between gnarled tree roots.  The faint scent of decay mingles with the sharp smell of pine sap."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":32,"x":60,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["A patchwork of terraced fields bound by low rock walls spreads to the south.  Between the cultivated rows, a tidy grid work of paths is still visible forming a subtle brocade of dark earth against the less-than-verdant vegetation.  Inexplicably, the acrid tang of smoke mingled with a hint of decay lingers in the air.  The road ends here, dwindling into a weed-choked trail leading into dark forest.","Gusting in fitful spurts, a chill breeze brings momentary relief from the stench of decay and smoke lingering in the air.  The rustling of leaves is audible at the trail penetrating the forest's boundaries, yet all traces of natural wildlife seem strangely absent.  Visible to the south, the lights of a settlement float dimly in the darkness like a beacon promising warmth and safety."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":33,"x":60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A malevolent garden borne of secrets unknown to mortals, the forest's edge is inviting to the adventurous of spirit, yet foreboding to the strong of mind.  Dark red-tinged creeper vines drape across skeletal claw-like trees, evoking the image of poisonous adders writhing in the sky above."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map133_Adders_Coil.xml"},
  {"id":34,"x":40,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Hunter's Glade, Northern Tract","descriptions":["A mature felenok pine reaches majestically skyward and seems to grasp the sun in its outstretched limbs.  Large, golden cones burden the ends of each branch, making them arc slightly downward.  Few felenok seeds survive to fulfill their purpose, as they are sweet to the palate of local squirrels that eagerly pry them from their cones before they drop to the ground.","A mature felenok pine reaches majestically skyward and seems to hold the heavens in its outstretched limbs.  Large cones burden the ends of each branch, making them arc slightly downward.  Few felenok seeds survive to fulfill their purpose, as they are sweet to the palate of local squirrels that eagerly pry them from their cones before they drop to the ground."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map128_Hunters_Glade.xml"},
  {"id":35,"x":20,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["A gate constructed from mismatched planks of wood is firmly wedged shut where two stone walls bordering the field converge.  The walls are pocked with deep gouges and blackened with streaks of soot.  Remnants of burnt vegetation crunch underfoot, although hints of green skirt the scorched tract to the north and west."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":36,"x":0,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Stunted and withered stalks of wheat are strangled by thick greenish-brown vines armed with cruel thorns.  Running parallel to the weathered stone wall at the edge of the field, a broad swathe of bare, scorched earth cuts across the untended rows.  The scent of smoke lingers unpleasantly in the night air.","Stunted and withered stalks of wheat are strangled by thick greenish-brown vines armed with cruel thorns.  Running parallel to the weathered stone wall at the edge of the field, a broad swathe of bare, scorched earth cuts across the untended rows.  The scent of smoke lingers unpleasantly, and only a few tracks of small animals give evidence that there are still regular visitors to the area."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":37,"x":20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Untidy sheaves of wheat, out of reach of the meager protection offered by the stone wall, lean against one another while weeds spring up around their bases.  A narrow strip of packed earth runs between the tangle of thorny vines and the wall.  Thready runners stretch across the bare ground, greedily reaching for the untouched greenery."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":38,"x":20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Curving west, the rock wall separates what's left of the field from the road and the edge of the forest.  Beneath a reddish-brown stain on the wall, a steel-bladed scythe lies forgotten and rusting in the grasp of the greenery.  Only patches of packed and scorched earth are bare of the omnipresent vines."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":39,"x":0,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Withered amethyst bloom vines hang limply against the stone wall, nearly engulfed by the rapacious thorny green vines.  Stretching toward the sky, a few hardy weeds stubbornly struggle to survive the engulfing tangle of vines.  Over the wall, the shadowy silhouette of Asketi's Mount blots out a large portion of the night sky.","Withered amethyst bloom vines hang limply against the stone wall, nearly engulfed by the rapacious thorny green vines.  Stretching toward the sky, a few hardy weeds stubbornly struggle to survive the engulfing tangle of vines.  Over the wall, a dense forest stretches northwards, blanketing part of the slope of Asketi's Mount."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":40,"x":0,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Curling away from the scorched strip of land to the south, the thorny vines form a tangled mat overwhelming the scattered clumps of withered wheat pushing up through the invasive vegetation.  Crops already engulfed slowly rot into mulch, fertilizing the vines and adding their aroma to the ashy scent hanging over the field."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":41,"x":-20,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Stunted and withered stalks of wheat are strangled by thick greenish-brown vines armed with cruel thorns.  Running parallel to the weathered stone wall at the edge of the field, a broad swathe of bare, scorched earth cuts across the untended rows.  The scent of smoke lingers unpleasantly in the night air.","Stunted and withered stalks of wheat are strangled by thick greenish-brown vines armed with cruel thorns.  Running parallel to the weathered stone wall at the edge of the field, a broad swathe of bare, scorched earth cuts across the untended rows.  The scent of smoke lingers unpleasantly, and only a few tracks of small animals give evidence that there are still regular visitors to the area."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":42,"x":-20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Withered amethyst bloom vines hang limply against the stone wall, nearly engulfed by the rapacious thorny green vines.  Stretching toward the sky, a few hardy weeds stubbornly struggle to survive the engulfing tangle of vines.  Over the wall, the shadowy silhouette of Asketi's Mount blots out a large portion of the night sky.","Withered amethyst bloom vines hang limply against the stone wall, nearly engulfed by the rapacious thorny green vines.  Stretching toward the sky, a few hardy weeds stubbornly struggle to survive the engulfing tangle of vines.  Over the wall, a dense forest stretches northwards, blanketing part of the slope of Asketi's Mount."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":43,"x":-20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Curling away from the scorched strip of land to the south, the thorny vines form a tangled mat overwhelming the scattered clumps of withered wheat pushing up through the invasive vegetation.  Crops already engulfed slowly rot into mulch, fertilizing the vines and adding their aroma to the ashy scent hanging over the field."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":44,"x":-40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Bled dry of life and color, a sickly silverwillow tree glimpsed over the crumbling wall is pierced by the red thorns of the thick green vines coiled about it.  The weight of the vines is slowly pulling the tree down.  More vines spill from over the wall into the field, and no sign of the original crops remains."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":45,"x":-40,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Several forlorn stalks of wheat still stand, seemingly huddled against the wall for protection against the voracious vines blanketing the rest of the field.  Occasionally something rustles through the greenery, causing the vines to seem to move with a life of their own.","Several forlorn stalks of wheat still stand, seemingly huddled against the wall for protection against the voracious vines blanketing the rest of the field.  Crows perch on the weathered rock, eyeing the abandoned bounty.  Occasionally something rustles through the greenery, causing the vines to seem to move with a life of their own."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":46,"x":-40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Outskirts, An Abandoned Field","descriptions":["Stunted and withered stalks of wheat are strangled by thick greenish-brown vines armed with cruel thorns.  Running parallel to the weathered stone wall at the edge of the field, a broad swathe of bare, scorched earth cuts across the untended rows.  The scent of smoke lingers unpleasantly in the night air.","Stunted and withered stalks of wheat are strangled by thick greenish-brown vines armed with cruel thorns.  Running parallel to the weathered stone wall at the edge of the field, a broad swathe of bare, scorched earth cuts across the untended rows.  The scent of smoke lingers unpleasantly, and only a few tracks of small animals give evidence that there are still regular visitors to the area."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":47,"x":60,"y":100,"z":1,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, The Vela'Tohr Feltery","descriptions":["Undyed wool rugs, woven in shades of russet and dull black, cover the floors.  The walls are cloaked with felted draperies of light brown adorned with bands of black kidskin embroidered with pale grey in a neat geometric pattern.  In the center of the shop, a cedar table covered with merchandise sits between two racks.  Shelves flank a stout door leading to the outside."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","aliases":["Feletry","Clothing"]},
  {"id":48,"x":60,"y":80,"z":1,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, The Vela'Tohr Feltery","descriptions":["The warm glow of oil lamps reveals a spacious hall.  Looms take up the central portion of the space, comfortable padded benches pulled up at each one.  Along the walls, cedar shelves are filled with orderly rows of baskets overflowing with balls of yarn.  Sacks of carded wool, ready to be spun, sit between a pair of spinning wheels positioned next to the dark windows.","Woven mats of sweet grass cover the floor of the spacious hall.  Looms take up the central portion of the space, comfortable padded benches pulled up at each one.  Along the walls, cedar shelves are filled with orderly rows of baskets overflowing with balls of yarn in hues of grey, cream and sable.  Sacks of carded wool, ready to be spun, sit between a pair of spinning wheels positioned next to the large windows facing north."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":49,"x":80,"y":60,"z":1,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Library","descriptions":["Freestanding shelves surround a large stone table in the center of the room.  Thick velvet draperies almost completely hide the walls from view.  At regular intervals wall sconces emerge from folds in the material, each bearing a softly glowing gaethzen orb."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Library"]},
  {"id":50,"x":60,"y":60,"z":1,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, The Vela'Tohr Feltery","descriptions":["This cellar is packed almost to the bursting point with various supplies.  Smoked goat and boar hang from the rafters.  Crocks of honey and wheels of goat cheese fill the shelves.  A path winds between barrels of cornmeal and kegs of salt, ending before a dark tunnel.  Necessities like blankets and simple tools, as well as wicker bins filled with potatoes and dried beans, are stacked near the tunnel.  Dusty crates provide access to a swirling iridescent cloud in the ceiling."],"exits":[],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map138_Asketis_Mount.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
